OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief constable recruitment
OL,4,Abrought forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police has brought
OL,7,Frecruitment for its chief constable
OL,8,Frole forward after advice from the
OL,9,Fpolice watchdog, leaders have said.
OL,11,FPolice and crime commissioner Alison
OL,12,FHernandez received a letter from the
OL,13,FChief Police Officers' Staff
OL,14,FAssociation outlining its intention to
OL,15,Fpursue legal action regarding her
OL,16,Fdecision to extend the contract of
OL,17,Finterim Chief Constable James Vaughan
OL,18,Fwithout running a recruitment process.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
